  "title": "EEG-VID: Task-Guided Latent Predictive Pretraining for EEG Decoding and Assistive Target Selection",
  "summary": "EEG-VID proposes a task-guided latent predictive pretraining framework for EEG decoding under session and subject shifts, with improved accuracy across multiple benchmarks. It achieves 6.52% Top-1 and 30.50% Top-5 accuracy on the VIG-48 task and 40.24% candidate-constrained target selection in a robot-scene study.",
  "facts": [
